User: In the diagram, point $E$ lies on line segment $AB$, and triangles $AED$ and $BEC$ are isosceles. Also, $\angle DEC$ is twice $\angle ADE$. What is the measure of $\angle EBC$ in degrees? [asy]
import olympiad;
import math;

size(7cm);

